#. module: partner_payer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_payer.field_res_partner__payer_partner_id
msgid ""
"Contact that settles the invoices of this customer, when payment comes from "
"another entity: the head office of a group paying for its members, for "
"instance. Leave it empty when the customer pays its own invoices. The "
"invoices are still issued to, and accounted for, this customer; only the "
"money arrives from the payer."
msgstr ""
"この顧客の請求を実際に支払う連絡先。グループの本部が配下の請求をまとめて支払"
"う場合などに設定する。顧客自身が支払う場合は空欄にする。請求書の発行先・計上"
"先はこの顧客のままで、入金だけが支払人から届く。"

#. module: partner_payer
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:partner_payer.field_res_partner__payer_partner_id
msgid "Payer"
msgstr "支払人"

#. module: partner_payer
#: code:addons/partner_payer/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid "%(name)s cannot be its own payer."
msgstr "%(name)s を自身の支払人にはできません。"

#. module: partner_payer
#: code:addons/partner_payer/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is the payer of other customers, so it cannot be paid for by "
"%(payer)s."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s は他の顧客の支払人になっているため、%(payer)s に支払ってもらうことは"
"できません。"

#. module: partner_payer
#: code:addons/partner_payer/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"%(payer)s is paid for by %(outer)s, so it cannot be the payer of %(name)s. "
"Point both customers at the same payer instead."
msgstr ""
"%(payer)s は %(outer)s に支払ってもらう設定のため、%(name)s の支払人にはでき"
"ません。両方の顧客を同じ支払人に向けてください。"
